      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Thanks to Sivcorp, we have been completely off-grid now for just over a year and it's been fabulous. It's nice not having to pay the power man. We have a 10KW off-grid system with 20KWh battery lithium batteries.  Sivcorp have been really good and we would recommend them to anybody.The power companies wanted to charge us over $15K to connect to the grid and now we are saving about $6,000 per year on power bills.The process with Sivcorp from quotation through to installation and after sale support have been fantastic. After talking to all the other solar companies, Sivcorp was the only company that had the solution for off-grid solar energy. All the other companies just wanted to connect us to the grid which was not what we wanted.12 months later, they are back to check up on us to see that everything is running well. They have have no secrets and they are there when you need them, Great after sale support!",
